Canonical app branding assets for Puppy Clicker.

- puppy_clicker.png — Puppy Clicker app/logo artwork.
- harleys_studios.png — Harley's Studios branding.
- PupEye.png — PupEye anti-cheat / fair-play branding.

Runtime stream endpoints:
- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/markhitchk/pup-clinker/main/assets/logos/puppy_clicker.png
- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/markhitchk/pup-clinker/main/assets/logos/harleys_studios.png
- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/markhitchk/pup-clinker/main/assets/logos/PupEye.png

The app streams branding from this folder at runtime and keeps a validated cache. Puppy Clicker and Harley's Studios also keep bundled fallbacks for Android system surfaces and offline startup. PupEye remains stream-only.
